./expeditions/2026-06-20-aoyagi-full/discuss-at-close.md:2902:## 122. The two combinatorial facts that #121 proved on paper are now MACHINE-CHECKED in Lean — the paper's central codimension identity (`minAdm = cCodim`, all widths) and its permutation-invariance, each clean-three and independently fidelity-audited. (2026-07-12)
